
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>My First Website</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial;
      text-align: center;
      background: #101827;
      color: white;
      margin: 0;
    }
    header {
      background: #087cf0;
      padding: 35px 15px;
    }
    section {
      padding: 35px 20px;
    }
    button {
      background: #087cf0;
      color: white;
      border: 0;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>WELCOME TO MY WEBSITE</h1>
  <p>Learning, Creativity and Success</p>
</header>

<section>
  <h2>About Us</h2>
  <p>Welcome to my first website!
  This is where I share my ideas and projects.</p>

  <h2>Our Goals</h2>
